<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="992a05d6">&lt;p&gt;
    During the process elaboration workshops, analyze the gaps that were identified that can not be met by Oracle&apos;s base
    out-of-the-box functionality and EY&apos;s pre-solutioned business process assets. Discuss alternatives with the client and
    document key decisions.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="7e22999d"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="8cd640c">&lt;p&gt;
    Where possible, control the scope of the work by fully leveraging Oracle&apos;s standard (out-of-the-box base) functionality
    and EY&apos;s pre-solutioned assets and minimize customizations. Obtain approval from the design authority on decisions that
    impact the scope.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
